    },
    "derivation": "JCS (RFC 8785 §3.2.2.2) does not escape '&', so {\"value\":\"&\"} stays {\"value\":\"&\"} and sha256 = 9a2fe282f2733070b5a91a182e97d8efdf6e94135e4790a73a380257200a2903.  Go's json.Marshal HTML-escaped it to \\u0026 and produced a different identifier; that defect is fixed in CLC-1.6."
